      "id": "claim_849893926f3c48d096e1df85fd388c05",
      "statement": "Triage enumerates the corpus directory non-recursively in sorted order, filtering on canonical extension sets declared in triage.py (PDF_EXTS, TEXT_EXTS, UNSUPPORTED_EXTS and their union SUPPORTED_EXTS) which are the single source of truth shared with the parser.",
