      "statement": "The PDF extraction chain is layered so each level covers the failure mode of the one before: Docling out-of-process first, falling through on any exception to pdfminer text plus pdfplumber typing, then to a pdfplumber-only extraction, and finally to an empty ParsedDoc.",
