      "id": "claim_849b7a1aae354b3f8f8ce851041c7d53",
      "statement": "Both pdfplumber extraction paths call page.flush_cache() after each page because pdfplumber retains the parsed object cache of every page it touches, which would otherwise exhaust memory on documents of several hundred pages.",
