    {
      "id": "claim_137318fd378f49c99e13d033e370fb06",
      "statement": "A font-mapping failure produces text that is present in volume but unreadable — (cid:NNN) tokens or Unicode replacement characters — which length- and structure-based confidence measures cannot detect; cid_failure_fraction measures the share of text occupied by these artifacts to expose it.",
